### 1. 单轮对话：DeepSeek（modelType = DEEPSEEK）
POST {{HOST}}/travel/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "trip-001",
  "message": "北京哪里好玩？",
  "modelType": "DEEPSEEK"
}

### 2. 多轮上下文：同一 requestId 连续提问，验证 ChatMemory 生效
POST {{HOST}}/travel/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "trip-001",
  "message": "三个人从云南来预算300够吗？",
  "modelType": "DEEPSEEK"
}

### 3. 切换模型：Qwen
POST {{HOST}}/travel/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "trip-002",
  "message": "你好，请用一句话介绍你自己",
  "modelType": "QWEN"
}
### 3.1 切换模型：Qwen
POST {{HOST}}/travel/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "trip-002",
  "message": "北京哪里好玩？",
  "modelType": "QWEN"
}

### 3.2 追问：Qwen
POST {{HOST}}/travel/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "trip-002",
  "message": "三个人从云南来预算300够吗？",
  "modelType": "QWEN"
}

### 3.3 模型：Qwen 不同 requestId
POST {{HOST}}/travel/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "trip-003",
  "message": "刚才都聊了什么",
  "modelType": "QWEN"
