### 4. 切换模型：Grok
POST {{HOST}}/travel/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "trip-003",
  "message": "你好，请用一句话介绍你自己",
  "modelType": "GROK"
}

### 5. 参数校验失败示例：requestId 为空
POST {{HOST}}/travel/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "",
  "message": "北京哪里好玩？",
  "modelType": "DEEPSEEK"
}
